General_SiSo_Auto_EnergySaving_Cell_TX_Switch_Responsiveness
    [Documentation]  Warning: Before running this TC ensure that:
    ...  IF ${power_saving_group_distns}==${None} at least one power saving group should be created on BTS.
    ...  IF ${power_saving_group_distns}!=${None} provided power saving group dist name(s) should exist on the BTS.
    ...  The purpose of this test case is to collect all timestamps described in CNI-137769 OM_GEN_SFS_PERF_CAP.33880 TX switching responsiveness
    ...  and verify whether the cell(s) configured in the power saving group(s) switch their TX OFF and ON within the KPI limits.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  ${power_saving_duration} (str): Duration of the power saving period in minutes. Default is 10 minutes.
    ...  ${power_saving_group_distns} (list): List of power saving group dist names to be used in the test. Default is ${None}.
    ...                                       e.g. ['MRBTS-50589/NRBTS-50589/NRPGRP-1', 'MRBTS-50589/NRBTS-50589/NRPGRP-2'].
    ...                                       If not provided, the test will use all configured power groups on BTS.

    [Arguments]      ${power_saving_duration}=10
    ...              ${power_saving_group_distns}=${None}
    [Timeout]        24 hours

    ${bts_type}=                                            hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                                          connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Set test variable                                       ${connection}
    config_operations.connect                               alias=${connection}

    Verify BTS And VM Time Match                            bts_type=${bts_type}
    
    IF  not $power_saving_group_distns
        ${power_saving_group_distns}=                       admin_info_model.get_power_saving_group_distnames
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    END
    ${power_saving_group_distns}=                           utilities.convert_to_list    ${power_saving_group_distns}

    ${tx_off_cells_distns}=                                 admin_info_model.get_cell_distnames_from_power_saving_groups
    ...                                                     power_group_distnames=${power_saving_group_distns}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${initial_param_values}                                 Get Initial Parameter Values Of Cell TX Energy Saving
    ...                                                     power_group_distns=${power_saving_group_distns}
    ...                                                     tx_off_cells_distns=${tx_off_cells_distns}

    ${now}=                                                 Get Current Date    result_format=datetime
    ${start_save_period}=                                   Add Time To Date    ${now.replace(second=0, microsecond=0)}  3 minutes  result_format=datetime
    ${end_save_period}=                                     Add Time To Date    ${start_save_period}  ${power_saving_duration} minutes  result_format=datetime

    Activate Cell TX Switch OFF Energy Saving And Wait Till End         
    ...                                                     tx_off_cells_distns=${tx_off_cells_distns}
    ...                                                     start_save_period=${start_save_period}
    ...                                                     end_save_period=${end_save_period}
    ...                                                     initial_param_values=${initial_param_values}
    ...                                                     power_saving_group_distns=${power_saving_group_distns}
    ...                                                     power_saving_duration=${power_saving_duration}

    ${cell_timestamps}=                                     btslog_parser.get_cell_tx_energy_saving_responsiveness_timestamps
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_distnames=${tx_off_cells_distns}
    ...                                                     start_time=${start_save_period}
    ...                                                     end_time=${end_save_period}

    btslog_verifiers.verify_cell_tx_off_on_switching_kpi    cell_timestamps=${cell_timestamps.copy()}

    Robot Log Operation                                     All cells from the tested power groups met the OFF/ON switching KPIs.
    Create Timestamps Results Message                       timestamps=${cell_timestamps}

    [Teardown]                                              Responsiveness Teardown


Get Initial Parameter Values Of Cell TX Energy Saving
    [Documentation]  This keyword returns the initial delta dictionary used to revert parameters to their original values in the teardown.
    ...              initial parameters to be collected are:
    ...              NR: actNrLBRTXPowerSaving, actNrLBmMimoRTXPowerSaving if mMIMO RMOD, actNrMixedSOMethod
    ...              LTE: actLBRTXPowerSaving
    ...              same for both NR, LTE: lbpsPeriodList, lbpsSOMethod, lbpsLastCellSOEnabled
    [Arguments]      ${power_group_distns}
    ...              ${tx_off_cells_distns}

    ${init_param_values}=                                   Get RAT Param Names Activating Cell TX Power Saving
    ...                                                     tx_off_cells_distns=${tx_off_cells_distns}
    
    FOR  ${distn}                                           IN    @{power_group_distns}
        ${pg_parameter_names}=                              Create List    lbpsPeriodList  lbpsSOMethod  lbpsLastCellSOEnabled
        ${pg_parameter_values}=                             config_operations.get_parameters_by_distname
        ...                                                 dist_name=${distn}
        ...                                                 parameter_list=${pg_parameter_names}
        Evaluate                                            $init_param_values.update({'${distn}': ${pg_parameter_values}})
    END
    Robot Log Result                                        Initial parameters values: ${init_param_values}

    [Return]    ${init_param_values}


Get RAT Param Names Activating Cell TX Power Saving
    [Documentation]  This keyword returns the dict of parameter names required to activate energy save period with
    ...              TX power saving for all RATs present in the provided power saving groups.
    ...              Parameter names to be checked:
    ...              - for NR: actNrLBRTXPowerSaving, actNrLBmMimoRTXPowerSaving if mMIMO RMOD
    ...              - for LTE: actLBRTXPowerSaving
    [Arguments]      ${tx_off_cells_distns}

    ${params_per_rat}=                                      Create Dictionary
    FOR   ${cell}                                           IN  @{tx_off_cells_distns}
        ${bts_rat_distn}=                                   admin_info_model.get_bts_rat_distn_from_distn
        ...                                                 dist_name=${cell}
        IF       'LNBTS' in '${bts_rat_distn}'
            ${param}=                                       Set Variable  actLBRTXPowerSaving
        ELSE IF  'NRBTS' in '${bts_rat_distn}'
            ${rmod}=                                        admin_info_model.get_rmod_distn_based_on_cell_distn
            ...                                             connection=${connection}
            ...                                             cell_distn=${cell}
            ${is_rmod_m_mimo}=                              admin_info_model.is_rmod_massive_mimo
            ...                                             connection=${connection}
            ...                                             rmod_distn=${rmod[0]}
            ${param}=                                       Set Variable If  ${is_rmod_m_mimo}
            ...                                             actNrLBmMimoRTXPowerSaving
            ...                                             actNrLBRTXPowerSaving
        END
        Evaluate                                            $params_per_rat.setdefault('${bts_rat_distn}', set()).add($param)
    END

    ${init_param_values}=                                   Create Dictionary
    FOR    ${bts_rat_distn}     ${params}                   IN  &{params_per_rat}
       ${params}=                                           Evaluate    list($params)
       ${act_ps_param_values}=                              config_operations.get_parameters_by_distname
       ...                                                  dist_name=${bts_rat_distn}
       ...                                                  parameter_list=${params}
       Evaluate                                             $init_param_values.update({'${bts_rat_distn}': ${act_ps_param_values}})
    END

   [Return]    ${init_param_values}


Activate Cell TX Switch OFF Energy Saving And Wait Till End 
    [Documentation]  This keyword activates the cell TX switch off energy saving and waits till the end of the power saving period.
    [Arguments]      ${tx_off_cells_distns}
    ...              ${start_save_period}
    ...              ${end_save_period}
    ...              ${initial_param_values}
    ...              ${power_saving_group_distns}
    ...              ${power_saving_duration}

    ${tx_off_cell_names}                                    Evaluate  [cell.split('/')[-1] for cell in $tx_off_cells_distns]

    Activate Cell TX Switch OFF Power Saving Period         initial_param_values=${initial_param_values}
    ...                                                     start_save_period=${start_save_period}
    ...                                                     duration=${power_saving_duration}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Power saving period will start at: ${start_save_period}, end at: ${end_save_period}\naffecting cells: ${tx_off_cell_names}

    Poll Keyword Until Timeout Or Failure                   ${start_save_period}    5s
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     ${connection}
    ...                                                     online
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${tx_off_cells_distns}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Power saving period started. Waiting for cells to enter 'reducedEnergySaving' state ...

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             15min    5sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     status_variant=reduced_energy_saving
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${tx_off_cells_distns}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Cells are in 'reducedEnergySaving' state. Waiting for the power saving period to end ...

    Poll Keyword Until Timeout Or Failure                   ${end_save_period}    5s
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     ${connection}
    ...                                                     reduced_energy_saving
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${tx_off_cells_distns}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Power saving period ended. Waiting for cells to come back online ...

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             15min    5sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     status_variant=online
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${tx_off_cells_distns}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Cells are back online.


Activate Cell TX Switch OFF Power Saving Period
    [Documentation]  This keyword activates the cell TX switch off power saving period.
    [Arguments]      ${initial_param_values}
    ...              ${start_save_period}
    ...              ${duration}

    ${delta}=                                               Create Dictionary
    Set Test Variable                                       ${initial_delta}    ${delta.copy()}

    ${lbps_period_list_structure}=                          config_operations.create_lbps_period_list
    ...                                                     start_time=${start_save_period}
    ...                                                     duration=${duration}

    FOR   ${distn}    ${initial_params}                     IN    &{initial_param_values}
        ${expected}=                                        Create Dictionary
        ...                                                 lbpsLastCellSOEnabled=true
        ...                                                 lbpsPeriodList=${lbps_period_list_structure}

        IF       'LNBTS' in '${distn}'
            Set To Dictionary                               ${expected}
            ...                                             actLBRTXPowerSaving=true
            ...                                             lbpsSOMethod=TX Switch Off
        ELSE IF  'NRBTS' in '${distn}'
            Set To Dictionary                               ${expected}
            ...                                             actNrLBRTXPowerSaving=true
            ...                                             actNrLBmMimoRTXPowerSaving=true
            ...                                             lbpsSOMethod=TX switch off
        END

        FOR     ${param}    ${current_val}                  IN    &{initial_params}
            IF  "${current_val}".lower() != "${expected}[${param}]".lower()
                Update Delta                                ${delta}  ${distn}  ${param}  ${expected}[${param}]  ${current_val}
            END
        END
    END

    IF  ${delta}
        delta_configurator.set_parameters_for_dist_names_via_delta_recommissioning
        ...                                                 objects_dict=${delta}
        Robot Log Operation                                 Cell TX Switch Off power saving period activated.
    ELSE
        Robot Log Operation                                 Parameters for activating the Cell TX Switch Off power saving period are already set to the expected.
    END
